.* Time zone descriptions: WRKTIMZON (four views of the list, F11 going
.* round them) and Display Time Zone Description Details (option 5),
.* with and without daylight saving time. Geometry from the 7.1
.* captures (verified/oracle71/timzon).
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=OFFCL BASETYPE='CHAR 6'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=MARKCL BASETYPE='CHAR 1'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TZCL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=ABBRCL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=FULLCL BASETYPE='CHAR 40'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=LONGCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=MSGCL BASETYPE='CHAR 7'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=WORDCL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=ALTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 132'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NUMCL BASETYPE='CHAR 4'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TIMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 8'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=OFFSET CLASS=OFFCL.
:VAR NAME=MARK CLASS=MARKCL.
:VAR NAME=TIMZON CLASS=TZCL.
:VAR NAME=ABBR CLASS=ABBRCL.
:VAR NAME=FULL CLASS=FULLCL.
:VAR NAME=DABBR CLASS=ABBRCL.
:VAR NAME=DFULL CLASS=FULLCL.
:VAR NAME=ALT CLASS=FULLCL.
:VAR NAME=TEXT CLASS=LONGCL.

:VAR NAME=ZONE CLASS=TZCL.
:VAR NAME=ZOFFSET CLASS=OFFCL.
:VAR NAME=STDFULL CLASS=LONGCL.
